meta {
  name: 00 READ ME first
  type: http
  seq: 0
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/health
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Student password reset and email-change checks (High auth hardening).

  Prep:
  1. `npm run start:testdb` and a seeded student (`studentEmail` /
     `Student-Pass1!` from the B2 Bruno fixture).
  2. For reset: run 01 Forgot, paste the six-digit code from the inbox into
     `studentResetCode`, then 02 Reset.
  3. For email change: run Student Activation / 00 Login first so
     `studentAccessToken` is set. 04 Patch needs a free address in
     `studentPendingEmail`. Paste the verification token from that inbox into
     `verificationToken`, then 05 Confirm pending email.

  03 is a pure validation check (no seed side effects).
}
